NOTE TO THE PROJECT OWNER (remove this block once resolved)

The supplied project contained inconsistent license declarations:
  * README.md badge:        "License-MIT"
  * README.md text (EN/ES): "License: GPL" (version not specified)
  * ip_monitor_gui.pyw:     no license header at all

The prose in both languages states GPL, so this file adopts GPL-3.0 as the
author's evident intent.  To finish the job:
  1. Confirm GPL-3.0 (or choose MIT and update this file plus README).
  2. Append the full GPL-3.0 text from https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt
     below this notice (it is ~35 KB and is deliberately not embedded here).
  3. Keep README.md, pyproject.toml ("license") and this file in agreement.
